+# S5-CLM-00003496 theorem package
+
+This package binds the frozen large-n Kotzig conjecture record to the claim-owned
+Lean surface and Stage 6 alias `S6-CLM-00004640` / `S6-VAR-00006418`.
+
+The provider declaration is sorry-backed and is retained solely as immutable
+statement provenance. `Statement.lean` proves exact proposition identity;
+`Proof.lean` exposes forward and reverse transports with all proof premises
+visible; `Audit.lean` checks the identity and transport boundary. Structured
+JSON holds the anchors, proof DAG, declaration census, R0 reconstruction,
+validation trace, and provisional release decision.
+
+Worker status is `provisional_release_candidate` with
+`master_accepted=false`. The only worker command is the claim-prescribed
+`--no-lean` validator. Canonical Master compilation and trust-zero semantic
+recomputation are deliberately outside this generation.
+
+Start with `intake.json`, then follow `statement-crosswalk.json`,
+`proof-units.json`, `full-study.md`, `machine-closure.json`, and
+`receipts/release-decision.json`.
